6 0 obj
<< /Length 2042 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 790 Td
(The Lighthouse Keeper's Ledger) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Every evening at dusk the keeper climbed the one hundred and twelve steps of the tower,) Tj T*
(wound the clockwork that turned the great lens, and wrote a single line in the ledger.) Tj T*
(Over forty years the ledger filled eleven volumes, and nearly every line recorded the same) Tj T*
(three facts: the time the lamp was lit, the direction of the wind, and the number of ships) Tj T*
(that passed before midnight.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Historians who later studied the ledgers found that the plain entries told a richer story) Tj T*
(than anyone expected. Long gaps between ships marked the winters when the northern harbour) Tj T*
(froze. A sudden rise in traffic matched the year a canal opened two hundred miles inland.) Tj T*
(Even the handwriting changed, growing smaller and more careful after the storm that) Tj T*
(destroyed the old pier.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The keeper never described the storm itself. The entry for that night reads only that the) Tj T*
(lamp was lit at seven minutes past five, that the wind blew from the south-west, and that) Tj T*
(no ships passed. The next morning, according to the harbour records, fishermen found the) Tj T*
(lantern room glass cracked in four places, yet the light had not gone out once during the) Tj T*
(night.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Today the tower is automated, and the ledgers rest in a climate-controlled archive beside) Tj T*
(navigation charts from the same decades. Researchers compare the two sources to estimate) Tj T*
(how shipping routes shifted as engines replaced sails. Their work depends on a simple) Tj T*
(practice repeated without fail: a person who wrote down what they saw, every single day,) Tj T*
(whether or not anything seemed to happen.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Visitors who reach the top of the tower can still read a copy of the first entry, framed) Tj T*
(beside the lens. It notes a calm sea, a light westerly breeze, and three fishing boats) Tj T*
(returning late with full nets.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
